{"url": "https://gmdcdiblong.co.in/Academic-Departmentsnew.php?department=f72ca5278453ae108d3374d14a7e42527373550f83ee6b2ada2b408e8718e762eb0dcc0307a2c375ee67acae5d7a35323338b85b3455aa9fde7c351593b1129b", "retrieved": "2026-10-02", "status": "ok", "final_url": "https://gmdcdiblong.co.in/Academic-Departmentsnew.php?department=f72ca5278453ae108d3374d14a7e42527373550f83ee6b2ada2b408e8718e762eb0dcc0307a2c375ee67acae5d7a35323338b85b3455aa9fde7c351593b1129b", "text": "Department\nGMDC, Diblong\n☰ MENU\nGMDC, DIBLONG\n🔍\nAbout\nAbout College\nMission & Vision\nProspectus\nAdministration\nGoverning body\nPrincipal\nTeaching Staff\nNon-Teaching Staff\nAcademics\nIntake Capacity\nCourses Offered\nEligibility for Admission\nCourse Structure and Combinations\nDepartments\nAssamese\nEnglish\nEconomics\nEducation\nHistory\nPolitical Science\nIQAC\nIQAC Committee\nIQAC Activities\nAQAR\nAcademic Calendar\nBest Practices\nDistinctiveness\nMinutes of Meetings\nSSR\nSSS\nIIQA\nNIRF\nNAAC\nLibrary\nEvents\nGallery\nContact Us\nDepartment of\nEDUCATION\nPrevious\nNext\nDepartment Notice |\nView All\nDepartment Profile\nFaculty\r\n                            Members\nActivities\nAchievements\nQuestion Paper\nSyllabus\nMagazine/Book\nEvents\nProfile\nAbout the Department:\nThe Department of Education was created concurrently with the college's inception\nin 2023. The Department of Education is committed to delivering high-quality\neducation and training to students, equipping them with the skills and knowledge\nnecessary to excel in the field of education. Currently, the Department comprises of\n3(three) faculties and offers BA (Bachelor of Arts) Programme aligned with the\nNEP 2020 (National Education Policy) 2020.\nVision:\n\"We envision developing the Department as a leading Advance Centre for creating\nlearner- centred, humane, and socially responsible educational professionals,\ncommitted to equity, excellence, and transformative impact.\"\nMission:\n1. Empowering educators, enriching communities, and enhancing lives through\ninnovativeteaching, learning, and research.\n2. Preparing compassionate, critically thinking, and creative educators who\ninspire andtransform the lives of their students.\n3. Fostering a culture of excellence, equity, and social justice in education,\npreparing leaderswho make a positive impact.\n4. Transforming lives through education, promoting academic excellence, and\nsupporting theholistic development of students, educators, and communities.\n5. Developing educators who are informed, reflective, and adaptive, committed\nto the pursuitof knowledge and the betterment of society.\n6. Preparing educators to address the challenges of a rapidly changing world,\nfosteringresilience, creativity, and global citizenship.\n7. Advancing education as a powerful tool for personal growth, social mobility,\nandcommunity development.\nFaculty Members\nBHAVNA DAULAGUPU\nAssistant Professor\n7002015744\ndaulagupubhavna4@gmail.com\nView Profile\nSOMA SAHA\nAssistant Professor\n8403088058\nsahasoma332@gmail.com\nView Profile\nVEVEEK THAOSEN\nAssistant Professor\n7002423585\nveveekthaozen83@gmail.com\nView Profile\nActivities\nID\nTitle\nDescription\nPublish\nFile\nAchievements\nID\nTitle\nDate\nView\nQuestion\nID\nPaper Code\nSemester\nYear\nView\nSyllabus\nID\nTitle\nDate\nView\n6\nSyllabus: FYUG (Education )\n2025-03-06\nView File\nMagazine/Book\nID\nTitle\nCover\nFile\nDepartmental Events\nTitle\nDescription\nDate\nFile\nAbout\nResults\nEvents\nStaff Login\nTenders\nGallery\nIQAC\nAQARs\nGauhati University\nAssam University\nUGC\nNAAC\nGMDC, Diblong\nDima Hasao, Assam, 788832\nGMDC, DIBLONG\nPowered by:\nS.S. Technologies", "links": [{"label": "", "url": "https://gmdcdiblong.co.in/index.php"}, {"label": "GMDC, DIBLONG", "url": "https://gmdcdiblong.co.in/index.php"}, {"label": "About College", "url": "https://gmdcdiblong.co.in/about.php"}, {"label": "Mission & Vision", "url": "https://gmdcdiblong.co.in/Academic-Departmentsnew.php?depa